liboauth2
------------------------------------------
Generic library to build C-based OAuth 2.x and OpenID Connect servers and
clients e.g. web-server plugins.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libcjose-devel-0.6.2.8-1bl1
  libcjose0-0.6.2.8-1bl1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libcurl4-8.23.0-1
  libhiredis-devel-1.4.1-1bl1
  libhiredis1-1.4.1-1bl1
  libjansson-devel-2.15.1-1
  libjansson4-2.15.1-1
  libmemcached-devel-1.1.4-1bl4
  libmemcached11-1.1.4-1bl4
  liboauth2-devel-2.4.0-1bl1
  liboauth2_1-2.4.0-1bl1
  libpcre2-devel-10.49-1
  libpcre2_8_0-10.49-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcjose-devel-0.6.2.8-1bl1
  libcurl-devel-8.23.0-1
  libhiredis-devel-1.4.1-1bl1
  libjansson-devel-2.15.1-1
  libmemcached-devel-1.1.4-1bl4
  libpcre2-devel-10.49-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/OpenIDC/liboauth2

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/OpenIDC/liboauth2/archive/refs/tags/v2.4.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack liboauth2-2.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./liboauth2-2.4.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/liboauth2-2.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboauth2-2.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboauth2_1-2.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liboauth2-devel-2.4.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

